    "scriptCode": "// --- HOPF FIBERS ---\n// Points of the 3-sphere: (cos(eta)*cos(u), cos(eta)*sin(u), sin(eta)*cos(u + a),\n// sin(eta)*sin(u + a)). For fixed eta and a this is a great circle, a FIBER of\n// the Hopf fibration; any two fibers are linked once. Six fibers on the Clifford\n// torus (eta = 45 degrees) and six on a thinner torus, each group spread by the\n// angle a. The curves live in 4D: the 4D rotations show them from new sides.\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\n//MESH_BEGIN\nu: 0, TAU, 200\nv: 0, TAU, 32\n//MESH_END\nfloat eta = (mesh < 5.5) ? 0.78539816 : 0.42;\nfloat a = mod(mesh, 6.0) * 1.04719755;\nreturn vec4(cos(eta)*cos(u), cos(eta)*sin(u), sin(eta)*cos(u + a), sin(eta)*sin(u + a));\n",
